---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "John Smth"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "no"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " End of work "
sp      = h     "space "

---SCREEN
."Basic commands on the screen"....

1. Exit, end of the page.. .:EX....
   Get help............... .:HE....             ."Active fields examples:"....
2. Menu choice:
   move cursor, press.... .sp.....              .mse............   (menu item)
3. Selector switch:
		forward... .sp.....             .alt1.
		backward.. .:DE....             .alt2.              (selector)
4. Switch context to edit:
   keep content........... .sp.....             .var.......     (input string)
   erase before edit...... .:DE....

5. Refresh screen......... .:RE....

=Editing commands (line editor)

6. Complete  input......... .:NL....    9. Fast cursor moving:
7. Erase character:                         string begin.... .:PR.... .:AL....
   left from cursor....... .:DE....         end of text..... .:PR.... .:AR....
   below cursor.. .:PR.... .:DE....     8. Toggle INS/OVR:
   to end of line. .:PR.... .sp.....                         .:PR.... .:PR....

